Package: rtcrcore
Title: Core Engine for Real-Time Clinical Data Review
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ashok", "Gunuganti", , "agunuganti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Connectors, mapping-spec compiler, collected data model,
    as-of engine and change log, standard derivations, check registry,
    review-state API and Excel review workbook for real-time clinical data
    review. Holds all logic that decides what a reviewer sees.
